MODIFICATIONS MADE IN THIS VENDORED COPY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. src/session.rs (the invisible-UX / session-key authentication module) has
   been REMOVED. The public template deliberately does not ship the
   invisible-UX implementation; consumers choose their own authentication
   strategy (default: the transaction sender signs directly).

2. src/lib.rs was adjusted accordingly: `pub mod session;` and
   `pub use session::{...}` were removed, and the module documentation was
   rewritten in English.

3. Cargo.toml: all `{ workspace = true }` inherited fields were expanded to the
   exact versions pinned in the upstream workspace
   (cosmwasm-std =2.0.4, cw-storage-plus =2.0.0, cw2 =2.0.0, etc.), so that
   this crate resolves independently of any parent workspace.

The `SessionError` variant remains defined in src/error.rs because it is
part of the upstream public error surface; it is simply unused by this
template.
